From 582df9e88ec6ce299c3217b2badbfa318fdb58b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gitman-101111 <development@spamfolder.xyz>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 10:23:09 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] mfd: add the Renesas SLG46824 GreenPAK used as reMarkable's
 wake controller

The SLG46824 on the Paper Pro Move latches wake sources (power button,
folio, pen, charger) while the SoC sleeps and gates a few peripheral
rails through its I2C virtual inputs (the NFC pen charger's supply among
them). Add the MFD core, the GPIO view of the virtual inputs, the
comparator reference regulator, and the wakeup controller that arms the
latches around suspend. Ported from reMarkable's linux-imx-rm 6.12 tree.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
